<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DoxasticTenure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> [ <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> ; <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tenureOfDoxasticState> ; <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#minQualifiedCardinality> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> ; <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onClass> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DoxasticState> ] .
