    skos:scopeNote "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:claimOfBelief and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:claimOfBelief (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."@x-gmeow-english ;
