    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:doxasticClaim is functional: one gmeow:DoxasticState carries its qualitative belief value through exactly one gmeow:StandpointClaim — the single bridge whose claimModality supplies the state's modality without domain-clashing claimModality onto DoxasticState. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."@x-gmeow-english ;
